  "netlist": "# two-voice optical theremin, CD40106, +12V\n\nRAW:     @+12V D1.A                      # before the protection diode\nV+:      D1.B IC1.14 C5.A                # protected rail\nGND:     @GND @VOL_3 @OUT_GND IC1.7 C5.B C1.B C2.B IC1.5 IC1.9 IC1.11 IC1.13\n\nV1_IN:   IC1.1 C1.A @V1_IN               # LDR1 one leg, timing cap\nV1_OUT:  IC1.2 C3.A @V1_RET              # LDR1 other leg, coupling cap +\nV1_MIX:  C3.B R1.A\n\nV2_IN:   IC1.3 C2.A @V2_IN\nV2_OUT:  IC1.4 C4.A @V2_RET\nV2_MIX:  C4.B R2.A\n\nMIX:     R1.B R2.B @VOL_1                # both voices meet, then the pot\nOUT:     @VOL_W @OUT               # wiper back from the pot, out to the jack"
